     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, Jan 16, 2020 at 8:49 PM Bin Lu &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">binl...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
