    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Dr. Yu,<div><br></div><div>I tried to use facet_plot (geom_facet not work now?) to join tree and alignment, but ggmsa seems not belong to geom method and I can not find a way to work. Any suggestion will be appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Best</div><div><br></div><div>Bin</div><div><br><br>在 2019年12月31日星期二 UTC+8下午12:02:57，Yu, Guangchuang写道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">it is possible. Currently you can use <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ggmsa</code>, <a href=\"https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/ggmsa\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/ggmsa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482152796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11vHfKUd23BLaMpmjxTQWT\">https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/ggmsa</a>, with <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">facet_plot</code>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">Eventually, we will update <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">msaplot</code> by incorporating <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ggmsa</code>. </p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5pdCBpcyBwb3NzaWJsZS4gQ3VycmVudGx5IHlvdSBjYW4gdXNlIGBnZ21zYWAsICZsdDto\r\ndHRwczovL2dpdGh1Yi5jb20vWXVMYWItU01VL2dnbXNhJmd0Oywgd2l0aCBgZmFjZXRfcGxvdGAu\r\nPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5FdmVudHVhbGx5LCB3ZSB3aWxsIHVwZGF0ZSBgbXNh\r\ncGxvdGAgYnkgaW5jb3Jwb3JhdGluZyBgZ2dtc2FgLiA8YnI+PC9kaXY+\" style=\"min-height:0px;width:0px;max-height:0px;max-width:0px;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0px;margin:0px\"></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Tue, Dec 31, 2019 at 11:55 AM Bin Lu &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">binl...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Dr. Yu,<div><br></div><div>Is there a way to plot sequence letters instead of color in maslot method? You know most times we want to display the interesting amino acids. If all are colors, it&#39;s not easily to see for readers</div><div><br></div><div>Look forward for your reply</div><div><br></div><div>Best</div><div><br></div><div>Bin</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n1. LG Wang, TTY Lam, S Xu, Z Dai, L Zhou, T Feng, P Guo, CW Dunn, BR Jones, T Bradley, H Zhu, Y Guan, Y Jiang, G Yu*. treeio: an R package for phylogenetic tree input and output with richly annotated and associated data. Molecular Biology and Evolution. 2019, accepted. <a href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msz240\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msz240&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482152796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1kGuqQ6UYNbg6jzUkKWNAd\">http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msz240</a><br>\r\n2. G Yu*, TTY Lam, H Zhu, Y Guan*. Two methods for mapping and visualizing associated data on p